"Links has existed almost as long as the Library, since the dawn of time."
"Links is a Category F Manifestation, a Library Core Manifestation of infinite duration."
"Links evolves often, because he has to, and grows more solid as the Library regains power."
"Links has gaps in his memory that he can sense but not fill, and they worsen."
"Malachite stirs one of Links's missing memories, beyond its use in opening doors."
"Links loves giving fines, and looks forward to the day fines resume."
"Links's oldest friend is Milaro, an elf king who spends much time at the Library."
"Links will call a Librarian his friend once she has earned it, and fight beside her."
